Last Day of Voting 1Section Find Your District 

Approved by voters during the 2025 Statewide Special Election, Proposition 50 changed the boundaries for U.S. House of Representatives districts in California for federal elections in 2026, 2028, and 2030. Use the interactive map located at ocvote.gov/findmydistrict to find the Congressional district in which you reside. You can either enter an address or use the interactive map to locate your newly adopted Congressional district. You can also find all of your districts using this tool. 

